    "issue_alignment": "The public issue states that duplicate entries in the filter list are not checked, potentially allowing unintended behavior due to repeated filters. In Service_FindServers the client-supplied serverUris list is the filter: duplicate URIs are not deduplicated, so each repeated entry matches the same registered server again and appends another pointer into foundServerFilteredPointer, which was allocated for only registeredServersSize entries. The result is an out-of-bounds heap write and a crash."
